	- `'command'`: the `result.escapedCommand`
	- `'output'`: one line from `result.stdout` or `result.stderr`
	- `'ipc'`: one IPC message from `result.ipcOutput`
	- `'error'`: the `error.shortMessage`
	- `'duration'`: the `result.durationMs`
