	Use full-length units: `5h 1m 45s` → `5 hours 1 minute 45 seconds`.

	@default false
	*/
	readonly verbose?: boolean;

	/**
	Show milliseconds separately. This means they won't be included in the decimal part of the seconds.

	@default false
